            "criterion_id": "9702_s19_43_q02_a_i_mp02",
            "observable": "Shows correct substitution: $n = \\frac{3.0 \\times 10^5 \\times 210 \\times 10^{-6}}{8.31 \\times 270}$ with volume converted correctly to $\\mathrm{m}^3$."
          },
          {
            "criterion_id": "9702_s19_43_q02_a_i_mp03",
            "observable": "Calculates amount of gas $n = 0.028\\,\\mathrm{mol}$ (or $0.0281\\,\\mathrm{mol}$)."
          }
        ]
